msgstr ""
"Controleer LCD-scripts tegen de nieuwe ``lcd`` ``type``\\ - / "
"``framesize``\\ -API (\\ :ref:`de LCD-herschrijving <v3_7_0_lcd>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"Drop the −128 bias when passing Y to ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`the yuv_to_* change"
